        {
          "text": "Unkalaki swimming in the Oceans sometimes visited the \"place of the gods\".",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "46" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wit arrived on Roshar through the perpendicularity while Rock still lived on the peaks.",
          "revealedIn": [
