        },
        {
          "text": "During the True Desolation, the Voidbringers seized and blockaded the perpendicularity from Shadesmar, hoping to control travel.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "108" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "With the Fused in control, travellers became rare, ships vanished on the way, and Fused warships demanded tribute from anyone they met.",
